      "description": "One gateway on the route mimic: plate number, label and account lamps. Aspect comes from data.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-node\" data-state=\"clear\" aria-label=\"2 · Gateway. 1 of 2 accounts ready\"><span class=\"ds-node-no\">2</span><span class=\"ds-node-label\">Gateway</span><span class=\"ds-node-lamps\"><span class=\"ds-lamp ds-lamp-clear\"></span><span class=\"ds-lamp ds-lamp-off\"></span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-node{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;height:32px;padding:0 9px 0 4px;border:1.5px solid var(--sb-ink,#1b1c19);border-radius:var(--sb-radius,2px);background:var(--sb-panel,#f1f1ea);color:var(--sb-ink,#1b1c19);font:700 13px/1 \"Barlow Semi Condensed\",Barlow,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),border-color 160ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);}.ds-node:hover{background:var(--sb-sunk,#d6d7ce);}.ds-node:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--sb-focus,#e8a20f);outline-offset:2px;}.ds-node-no{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:20px;height:20px;padding:0 3px;background:var(--sb-plate,#1b1c19);color:var(--sb-plate-ink,#f1f1ea);border-radius:1px;}.ds-node-lamps{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:3px 4px;background:var(--sb-track,#1b1c19);border-radius:1px;}.ds-lamp{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lamp,#3a3b36);}.ds-lamp-clear{--lamp:var(--sb-lamp-clear,#fbf6dc);}.ds-lamp-off{--lamp:var(--sb-track-empty,#3a3b36);}.ds-node[data-state=\"off\"]{border-style:dashed;border-color:var(--sb-rule-strong,#8d8f85);color:var(--sb-ink-3,#52544b);background:transparent;}.ds-node[data-state=\"danger\"]{border-color:var(--sb-lamp-danger,#d0371f);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--sb-lamp-danger,#d0371f);}"
    }
